45. CLI INSERT CONTRACT
==================================================

The CLI must only insert artifacts that exist in staging.

Example:

proposal-cli insert \
  --project "D:\Project\ExistingProject" \
  --generated "output\NEWPLAN"

Before insertion:

proposal-cli insert \
  --project "D:\Project\ExistingProject" \
  --generated "output\NEWPLAN" \
  --dry-run

Then:

proposal-cli insert \
  --project "D:\Project\ExistingProject" \
  --generated "output\NEWPLAN" \
  --confirm


The CLI should refuse insertion if:

- generation is incomplete
- validation has fatal failures
- required test results are missing
- approval is missing
- ProductCode collision exists
- target project cannot be validated
- generated artifact is missing
- generated artifact hash does not match expected staging artifact


