54. FINAL PHILOSOPHY
==================================================

The goal is NOT to build an impressive AI demo.

The goal is NOT to create a generic PDF converter.

The goal is NOT to let an autonomous AI rewrite the existing project.

The goal is to automate the real developer workflow:

COPY
→ RENAME
→ UNDERSTAND DIFFERENCES
→ MODIFY
→ MOCK WHEN NECESSARY
→ GENERATE
→ TEST
→ PREVIEW
→ COMPARE
→ APPROVE
→ INSERT

AI provides intelligence.

Deterministic code provides safety.

The existing project provides the contract.

The benchmark provides the reusable implementation pattern.

PDF A provides the target.

PDF B provides realistic reference data and golden output.

ProposalDefinition provides the canonical intermediate representation.

The Test Harness proves the generated report works.

Staging isolates generated work from the real project.

CLI Insert provides the controlled boundary into the real project.

This separation is mandatory.